@startuml selma_architecture_certification
' ============================================================
' Selma — Architectural Certification State Machine
' Source:  docs/spec/contracts/certification/gates.yaml (AA-01 … AA-07)
' C4:      certification_tool → artifacts_repository → artifacts_store
'          trigger: CI/CD → api
' Contract: 1.0.0
' ============================================================

title Selma — Architectural Certification FSM\n<size:12><i>offline/CI seven-gate audit (not C4 peer) · hierarchical AA composite · no runtime policy contamination</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> Triggered : <b>CertificationTriggered</b>\nactor: System (optional CI client | certification_tool)\ncommand: start certification run\n/ startCertification()

state "Triggered" as Triggered #B9770E : **entry** certification run_id assigned\n**allowed** collect evidence\n**forbidden** skip gates
state "Collecting\nEvidence" as CollectingEvidence #1B7A6E : **entry** load CG-IR samples\nevent stream excerpts\ncompiler assertion output\nsource path inventory\n**forbidden** mutate domain FSMs

' ---------- Hierarchical composite: sequential AA gates ----------
state "Validating Gates" as ValidatingGates #1B7A6E {
  [*] --> AA01
  state "AA-01\nMediated Feedback" as AA01 #1B7A6E : **entry** analytics has no write path\nto CG-IR / Finding FSM\nmethod: integration (no finding→compile)
  state "AA-02\nDeclarative Governance" as AA02 #1B7A6E : **entry** doctrine guidance_only via\ndirectives_repository; absent from\nevaluation/FSM paths\nmethod: static analysis + path assert
  state "AA-03\nEvaluator Purity" as AA03 #1B7A6E : **entry** no IO / randomness / env\nmethod: AST / sandbox purity
  state "AA-04\nSegregation of Duties" as AA04 #1B7A6E : **entry** waive + approve SoD tests\nmethod: integration SoD corpus
  state "AA-05\nConflict Determinism" as AA05 #1B7A6E : **entry** byte-identical replay\nmethod: conflict replay corpus
  state "AA-06\nDiscriminator Completeness" as AA06 #1B7A6E : **entry** invalid type/config corpus\nmethod: discriminator rejection set
  state "AA-07\nPortable Serialization" as AA07 #1B7A6E : **entry** RE2 canaries · UTC/NaN\nmethod: portability canaries

  AA01 --> AA02 : <b>CertificationGatePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa01()
  AA02 --> AA03 : <b>CertificationGatePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa02()
  AA03 --> AA04 : <b>CertificationGatePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa03()
  AA04 --> AA05 : <b>CertificationGatePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa04()
  AA05 --> AA06 : <b>CertificationGatePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa05()
  AA06 --> AA07 : <b>CertificationGatePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa06()
  AA07 --> [*] : <b>CertificationGatePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa07()
}

state "Passed" as Passed #2C6E49 : **entry** all gates green\n**allowed** seal certification artifact\n**forbidden** mutate Directive Graph
state "Failed" as Failed #A93226 : **entry** one or more gates red\n**allowed** write fail evidence\n**forbidden** certify
state "Rejected" as Rejected #A93226 : **entry** evidence incomplete\nor non-reproducible run\n**allowed** remediate then re-run\n**forbidden** certify
state "Certified" as Certified #2C6E49 : **entry** certification artifact sealed\n**allowed** archive · optional long-term export\n**forbidden** alter gate report
state "Remediation\nRequired" as RemediationRequired #B9770E : **entry** engineering fixes needed\n**allowed** new commit / rebuild\n**forbidden** mutate CG-IR · Finding FSM · Directive Graph
state "Archived" as Archived #4A4A4A : **entry** immutable retention **terminal**\n**allowed** read-only audit\n**forbidden** rewrite

Triggered --> CollectingEvidence : <b>CertificationEvidenceCollecting</b>\nactor: System (certification_tool)
CollectingEvidence --> ValidatingGates : <b>CertificationEvidenceReady</b>\nactor: System
CollectingEvidence --> Rejected : <b>CertificationRejected</b>\nactor: System\n/ incompleteCorpus()

' Completion of composite (all AA gates PASS)
ValidatingGates --> Passed : <b>CertificationGatesComplete</b>\nactor: System

' External exits from nested substates (any FAIL leaves composite)
AA01 --> Failed : <b>CertificationGateFailed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa01()
AA02 --> Failed : <b>CertificationGateFailed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa02()
AA03 --> Failed : <b>CertificationGateFailed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa03()
AA04 --> Failed : <b>CertificationGateFailed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa04()
AA05 --> Failed : <b>CertificationGateFailed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa05()
AA06 --> Failed : <b>CertificationGateFailed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa06()
AA07 --> Failed : <b>CertificationGateFailed</b>\nactor: System\n/ gateAa07()

Passed --> Certified : <b>CertificationSealed</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: write-once pass evidence + gate report
Failed --> RemediationRequired : <b>CertificationFailed</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: gate-id fail report\nstory: US-GA-001
Rejected --> RemediationRequired : <b>CertificationRemediationRequired</b>\nactor: System

Certified --> Archived : <b>CertificationArchived</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: retain + async optional long-term export
RemediationRequired --> Triggered : <b>CertificationRetriggered</b>\nactor: System (optional CI client | certification_tool)\ncommand: new certification run_id
Archived --> [*] : <b>Finalized</b>\nactor: System

@enduml
